# Deployed to Linux hosts: force LF so Windows autocrlf checkouts / scp do not
# ship CRLF and 203/EXEC the shebang (see 2026-06 pg-backup incident).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.timer text eol=lf

# The ledger is a bullet list edited from both machines; union merge
# keeps both sides instead of conflicting (claude-config
# rules/ledger.md, "Merge conflicts").
LEDGER.md merge=union
